  dialogue: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ee872b59c9b687845a42a5728cf7c643, type: 2}
  pageGroupID: DenialNote1
  noteText: "I think I'm in a different world, or at least that is what the strange
    being has told me.\r\nThe last thing I can remember is being on the sea\u2026\r\nThere
    are still so many questions I have that have not been answered.\r\nIt feels like
    the being hasn\u2019t told me everything they know, I could try getting more\r\ninformation
    out of them.\r\nI pray I can find a way back to the life i once knew to continue
    my research"
